# The circuit's own build output (target/) is committed on purpose: target/proof and
# target/public_inputs are the fixed test vector RealVerifierIntegration.t.sol reads, and
# target/jwt_recovery.json / target/vk are what `bb write_solidity_verifier` and `bb verify` were
# actually run against for this sprint's proof-of-life. target/live/{proof,public_inputs} are the
# exact bytes submitted in the real Base Sepolia recovery-loop run (see the sprint writeup for the
# addresses/tx hashes). Regenerate any of it per JwtRecoveryVerifier.sol's header comment;
# *witness.gz are the large, trivially regenerable intermediates not worth keeping.
target/witness.gz
target/live-witness.gz

verifier/out/
verifier/cache/

js/node_modules/
